\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Behold, blessed are those Jesus
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Changes to become His bridesgroom
\par And they worship in His church
\par Thro' the times of might and vigour,
\par By His side they stay and worship,
\par :/: Through all morning and all noon.:/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Who knows how much glory's due them?
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj None can estimate their reward;
\par It is perfectly concealed.
\par  E'en the heights of heaven know not
\par  How much love their righteous monarch
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj :/: Has for those that do love Him. :/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. And if Seraphim out of fright,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Do conceal their countenances,
\par  The bride shall not be afraid.
\par  Thus, with mastered confidence, He
\par  Does observe the King on the throne
\par  :/: And His face is made to glow. :/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Out of great fear, out of great fright,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Do they serve the mighty monarch
\par In His holy of holies?
\par And the children of the bridegroom,
\par When they Look unto their monarch
\par :/: They are filled with great relief. :/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5. Lord, I humbly do request You,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To graciously grant your insight
\par And your nature unto me.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  Help me carve a managed life here,
\par  And reject the rots of this life,
\par :/:  And become your perfect bride.:/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Though I saw it not, it's my hope
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  Till such period as is ordained,
\par  For Him to meet me again.
\par  It is through His rites of wedding,
\par  I shall have all that I believed,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj :/:   And His love shall overflow. :/:
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

